Dear colleagues,

I'm dealing with symmetric and asymmetric shape components of rodent skulls. I use bilat.symmetry() to get corresponding components and to perform two-way Procrustes ANOVA to test directional and fluctuating asymmetry for significance. Significance of interaction between side and individual is very important to me because comparison of fluctuating asymmetry between groups is one of my goals.
When using geomorph 3.0.7 (under R 3.4.4) I got the following result:

