But after updating to version 3.1.1 (under R 3.5.3) key result become insignificant:

> summary(skull.sym)
Call: bilat.symmetry(A = dat, ind = meta$id, replicate = meta$measurement, object.sym = T, land.pairs = pairs, iter = 999)
